{"id":34,"flavor":[{"games":["Shield"],"text":"Nidoking prides itself on its strength. It’s forceful and spirited in battle, making use of its thick tail and diamond-crushing horn."},{"games":["Sword"],"text":"When it goes on a rampage, it’s impossible to control. But in the presence of a Nidoqueen it’s lived with for a long time, Nidoking calms down."},{"games":["Let’s Go, Eevee!","Let’s Go, Pikachu!","Yellow"],"text":"Its steel-like hide adds to its powerful tackle. Its horns are so hard, they can pierce a diamond."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Omega Ruby","Sapphire","Ruby"],"text":"Nidoking’s thick tail packs enormously destructive power. With one swing, it can topple a metal transmission tower. Once this Pokémon goes on a rampage, there is no stopping it."},{"games":["Y","White 2","Black 2","White","Black","Platinum","Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"One swing of its mighty tail can snap a telephone pole as if it were a matchstick."},{"games":["X","FireRed"],"text":"It is recognized by its rock-hard hide and its extended horn. Be careful with the horn, as it contains venom."},{"games":["SoulSilver"],"text":"Its tail is thick and powerful. If it binds an enemy, it can render the victim helpless quite easily."},{"games":["HeartGold","Gold"],"text":"It swings its big tail around during battle. If its foe flinches, it will charge with its sturdy body."},{"games":["LeafGreen","Blue","Red"],"text":"It uses its powerful tail in battle to smash, constrict, then break the prey’s bones."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"A NIDOKING’s thick tail packs enormously destructive power capable of toppling a metal transmission tower. Once it goes on a rampage, there is no stopping it."},{"games":["Crystal"],"text":"It uses its thick arms, legs and tail to attack forcefully. Melee combat is its specialty."},{"games":["Silver"],"text":"Its tail is thick and powerful. If it binds an enemy, it can snap the victim's spine quite easily."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Poison Point","hidden":false,"description":"Contact with the Pokémon may poison the attacker."},{"name":"Rivalry","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon's competitive spirit makes it deal more damage to Pokémon of the same gender, but less damage to Pokémon of the opposite gender."},{"name":"Sheer Force","hidden":true,"description":"Removes any additional effects from the Pokémon's moves, but increases the moves' power."}],"eggGroups":["Monster","Field"],"genderRate":0,"hatchCounter":20,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium slow","habitat":"grassland","color":"Purple","shape":"Upright","evolution":{"id":32,"name":"Nidoran♂","condition":null,"children":[{"id":33,"name":"Nidorino","condition":"Lv. 16","children":[{"id":34,"name":"Nidoking","condition":"Use Moon Stone","children":[]}]}]},"moves":{"game":"Sword / Shield","level":[[0,224],[1,24],[1,30],[1,31],[1,40],[1,43],[1,64],[1,92],[1,116],[1,260],[1,270],[1,390],[1,398],[1,414]],"machine":[133,213,419,251,59,776,34,280,523,91,406,529,414,89,203,263,126,7,53,374,411,116,416,270,506,667,63,58,8,196,231,25,5,224,341,200,6,398,182,240,156,350,157,317,496,328,201,247,421,214,188,482,684,173,446,707,444,164,241,276,57,269,168,675,87,9,85,390,253,599,474,250],"egg":[],"tutor":[815]},"cards":[{"id":"sv10-233","name":"Team Rocket's Nidoking ex","set":"Destined Rivals","date":"2025-05-30","rarity":"Special Illustration Rare","number":"233","artist":null,"img":"sv10/233"},{"id":"sv10-119","name":"Team Rocket's Nidoking ex","set":"Destined Rivals","date":"2025-05-30","rarity":"Double Rare","number":"119","artist":null,"img":"sv10/119"},{"id":"sv10-216","name":"Team Rocket's Nidoking ex","set":"Destined Rivals","date":"2025-05-30","rarity":"Ultra Rare","number":"216","artist":null,"img":"sv10/216"},{"id":"sv3pt5-34","name":"Nidoking","set":"151","date":"2023-09-22","rarity":"Rare","number":"34","artist":"Shiburingaru","img":"sv3pt5/34"},{"id":"sv3pt5-174","name":"Nidoking","set":"151","date":"2023-09-22","rarity":"Illustration Rare","number":"174","artist":